  <Properties>
    <blocks>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "30a0d072-7837-449e-9db2-228afed80595",
      "key": "b0b59fca-72ca-463c-a956-fd0bee742b9e",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "text",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "Layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\u0022\u003EHello Cavalier Community,\u0026nbsp;\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\u0022\u003EI am truly honored to serve this community as the new Santiago High School principal. I am excited to help continue the many Santiago traditions valued by our community, as well as focus on continuing our academic successes (GGUSD Goal 1), our multiple programs supporting mental health and wellness (GGUSD Goal 2), all while preparing our students to be successful, civic-minded critical thinkers (GGUSD Goal 3).\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\u0022\u003ESantiago High School continues to make excellent gains in all academic areas. Last year, we were awarded the California Distinguished School Award, demonstrating the commitment to excellence of our faculty and staff and their dedication to continual improvement. As a partner of California Community Schools, Santiago continues to provide partnerships with community agencies to offer integrated health and social services, expanded learning time, family engagement, and collaborative leadership to remove barriers to student learning.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\u0022\u003EOur campus is honored to be named an AVID National Demonstration School, placing us in the top 3% of all AVID schools worldwide. This recognition reflects our school-wide dedication to rigorous writing, inquiry, collaboration, organization and reading, as well as student-led learning strategies designed to boost college and career readiness in every classroom. As an elite regional model, we showcase exceptional student achievement, collaboration, and academic growth.\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\u0022\u003EHere\u0027s to honoring our traditions while embracing new opportunities!\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\u0022\u003EGo Cavaliers!\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
